# Build context of the production images (deploy/docker/*.Dockerfile). Only source the images read goes in:
# no git data, no local state, no secrets (.env*, local.properties), no tests, no Android or spec material.
.git
**/.git
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/tests
**/e2e
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/local.properties
var
reports
Plan
docs
apps/field-android
ops
